<title>UK: Spintab sets $100 million May 1998 FRN.</title>
<headline>Spintab sets $100 million May 1998 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPINTAB</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    10.MAY.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE   S10.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.054   FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT LAST COUPON</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
